label wardrobeIsClosed
I turn the closet handle and feel pressure from the inside.
I slowly open the closet, but the weight from within forces the door wide open.
I jump back in fear.
[signal arg="Bathroom_ClothesFallsOut"]
A pile of women's clothes spills out of the closet.
[end_timeline]
label wardrobeIsOpened
There is nothing else in the closet.
[end_timeline]